- # `↯/s.118.10` — `Tel.Provider.Error`
+ # `↯/s.118.10` — `Tel.Provider.Error`

- Raised when a TEL document does not conform to the schema a `Tel.Provider` reads it by.
+ Se lanza cuando un documento TEL no se ajusta al esquema con el que lo lee un `Tel.Provider`.

- ## Cause
+ ## Causa

- Stratiform's `Tel.Provider` reads a document through its schema as a record's fields are read,
- and reports each mismatch through the `Tactic` of the code reading the field, so that a
- validating reader can collect them all. The message is `the TEL did not conform to its schema
+ El `Tel.Provider` de Stratiform lee un documento a través de su esquema a medida que se leen los
+ campos de un registro, y notifica cada discrepancia mediante la `Tactic` del código que lee el
+ campo, de modo que un lector que valida puede recogerlas todas. El mensaje es `the TEL did not conform to its schema

- because $reason`.
+ because $reason`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Variantes

- ### `↯/s.118.10.1` — `Absent`
+ ### `↯/s.118.10.1` — `Absent`

- A field the schema requires is missing from the document.
+ Falta en el documento un campo que el esquema exige.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.118.10.1] the TEL did not conform to its schema because the field first-name is required`
+ **Ejemplo.** `[↯/s.118.10.1] the TEL did not conform to its schema because the field first-name is required`

- **Resolution.** Add the field, or make it optional in the schema.
+ **Solución.** Añade el campo, o hazlo opcional en el esquema.

- ### `↯/s.118.10.2` — `NotSigil`
+ ### `↯/s.118.10.2` — `NotSigil`

- A field read by the `Sigil` validator holds an atom of more than one character.
+ Un campo leído por el validador `Sigil` contiene un átomo de más de un carácter.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.118.10.2] the TEL did not conform to its schema because the value ab is not a single character`
+ **Ejemplo.** `[↯/s.118.10.2] the TEL did not conform to its schema because the value ab is not a single character`

- **Resolution.** Give the field a single character.
+ **Solución.** Da al campo un solo carácter.

